Pharmaceutic% the Valkyrie just found a wand of wishing on level 1.  Five
wishes later, she was one of the best kitted out characters I've ever had.

By level 3, she was dipping her (rust proofed) long sword.  She
unleashes a water demon.  No problem: with Ac -8 he can do little
damage, and with her speed boots, Pharmaceutic can easily escape.

So the demon calls on Yeenoghu.  Even with grey dragon scale mail, and
an amulet of reflection, she stands no chance.  Almost before I realize
what's going on, it's all over.

Sob!  I'm off home now for a cup of tea.  Sometimes I think I'm *never*
going to beat this game.

Tim.

